{% comment %}
Transition Featured Findings Section
Displays top 3 findings for this transition
{% endcomment %}

<section class="transition-featured-findings" id="featured-findings">
  <div class="transition-featured-findings__container">
    
    <h2 class="transition-featured-findings__title">Key Findings</h2>
    
    <div class="transition-featured-findings__grid">
      <article class="transition-finding-card">
        
        <div class="transition-finding-card__number">
          FINDING 002
        </div>

        <h3 class="transition-finding-card__title">The First 30 Minutes After Waking Are Not Like The Rest Of The Day</h3>

        <p class="transition-finding-card__excerpt">
          The morning window determines the quality of your entire day. What you do in the first 30 minutes shapes your nervous system baseline for the next 16 hours.
        </p>

        <p class="transition-finding-card__published">
          Published May 2026
        </p>

        <a href="/blogs/journal/the-first-30-minutes-after-waking-are-not-like-the-rest-of-the-day" class="transition-finding-card__link">
          Read Finding →
        </a>

      </article>

      <article class="transition-finding-card">
        
        <div class="transition-finding-card__number">
          FINDING 001
        </div>

        <h3 class="transition-finding-card__title">Why Your Brain Turns On The Moment You Get Into Bed</h3>

        <p class="transition-finding-card__excerpt">
          What appears to be insomnia is often your nervous system doing exactly what it's designed to do. The activation you feel is a natural protective mechanism.
        </p>

        <p class="transition-finding-card__published">
          Published April 2026
        </p>

        <a href="/blogs/journal/why-your-brain-turns-on-the-moment-you-get-into-bed" class="transition-finding-card__link">
          Read Finding →
        </a>

      </article>

      <article class="transition-finding-card">
        
        <div class="transition-finding-card__number">
          FINDING 005
        </div>

        <h3 class="transition-finding-card__title">Morning Light Exposure & Circadian Anchoring</h3>

        <p class="transition-finding-card__excerpt">
          The first light exposure after waking is the strongest circadian signal available. Timing and intensity matter more than duration.
        </p>

        <p class="transition-finding-card__published">
          Published March 2026
        </p>

        <a href="/blogs/journal/morning-light-exposure-and-circadian-anchoring" class="transition-finding-card__link">
          Read Finding →
        </a>

      </article>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .transition-featured-findings {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .transition-featured-findings__container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .transition-featured-findings__title {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #1a1a18;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .transition-featured-findings__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .transition-finding-card {
    background: #faf7f2;
    border: 1px solid rgba(26, 26, 24, 0.08);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .transition-finding-card:hover {
    background: #f5f2ed;
  }

  .transition-finding-card__number {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    color: #999;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .transition-finding-card__title {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #1a1a18;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .transition-finding-card__excerpt {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .transition-finding-card__published {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #999;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .transition-finding-card__link {
    color: #1a1a18;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .transition-finding-card__link:hover {
    color: #666;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .transition-featured-findings {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .transition-featured-findings__title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Featured Findings",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}